[2026-02-04T18:06:41.638Z] [STDOUT] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01EYkUUcsSRX2QNXJCrEXMyu","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Russia casualties Ukraine war 1.2 million 2022-2026 verified estimates\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Casualties of the Russo-Ukrainian war - Wikipedia\",\"url\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Casualties_of_the_Russo-Ukrainian_war\"},{\"title\":\"Report warns that combined casualties in Russia's war on Ukraine could hit 2 million - ABC News\",\"url\":\"https://abcnews.go.com/International/wireStory/new-report-warns-combined-war-casualties-russias-war-129628462\"},{\"title\":\"Report warns combined casualties in Russia's war on Ukraine could soon hit 2 million | PBS News\",\"url\":\"https://www.pbs.org/newshour/world/report-warns-combined-casualties-in-russias-war-on-ukraine-could-soon-hit-2-million\"},{\"title\":\"Russia and Ukraine's combined war casualties could reach 2 million soon, report estimates | KSL.com\",\"url\":\"https://www.ksl.com/article/51439527/russia-and-ukraines-combined-war-casualties-could-reach-2-million-soon-report-estimates\"},{\"title\":\"Putin's Great Disaster: Russia Can't 'Win' the Ukraine War with 1.2 Million Casualties - 19FortyFive\",\"url\":\"https://www.19fortyfive.com/2026/02/putins-great-disaster-russia-cant-win-the-ukraine-war-with-1-2-million-casualties/\"},{\"title\":\"Russia’s Grinding War in Ukraine | CSIS\",\"url\":\"https://www.csis.org/analysis/russias-grinding-war-ukraine\"},{\"title\":\"Russia’s military losses in Ukraine surpass any major power since WWII. Yet re-deployed wounded obscure the true toll. — Meduza\",\"url\":\"https://meduza.io/en/feature/2026/01/29/russia-s-military-losses-in-ukraine-surpass-any-major-power-since-wwii-yet-re-deployed-wounded-obscure-the-true-toll\"},{\"title\":\"Casualties in Ukraine war could hit 2 million, report warns\",\"url\":\"https://www.defensenews.com/global/europe/2026/01/28/casualties-in-ukraine-war-could-hit-2-million-report-warns/\"},{\"title\":\"Over 400,000 Russians killed, wounded for 0.8 percent of Ukraine in 2025 | Russia-Ukraine war News | Al Jazeera\",\"url\":\"https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/1/2/over-400000-russians-killed-wounded-for-0-8-percent-of-ukraine-in-2025\"},{\"title\":\"Russia denies think-tank assessment that 1.2 million of its troops have been killed or injured in Ukraine war | CBC News\",\"url\":\"https://www.cbc.ca/news/world/russia-ukraine-war-dead-estimates-9.7064462\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, here are the verified estimates for Russian casualties in the Ukraine war:\n\n## Key Verified Estimate\n\nRussia suffered 1.2 million casualties, including up to 325,000 troop deaths, between the start of Moscow's full-scale invasion in February 2022 and December 2025, according to a report from the Center for Strategic and International Studies (CSIS).\n\n## How These Estimates Were Compiled\n\nThe figures from the CSIS were compiled using the Washington, D.C.-based think tank's own analysis, data published by independent Russian news site Mediazona with the BBC, estimates by the British government and interviews with state officials. Mediazona, together with the BBC and a team of volunteers, has so far collected the names of over 160,000 troops killed by scouring news reports, social media and government websites.\n\n## Significance\n\nRussian forces have suffered approximately 1.2 million casualties (killed, wounded, and missing) and as many as 325,000 killed since February 2022. No major power has suffered anywhere near these numbers of casualties or fatalities in any war since World War II.\n\n## Additional Context\n\nThe report estimated that at current rates, combined Russian and Ukrainian casualties may be as high as 1.8 million and could reach 2 million by the spring.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id